        <mxCell id="app" value="&lt;b style='font-size:16px'&gt;APPLICATION SUBNET&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CIDR: &lt;b&gt;10.10.0.64/26&lt;/b&gt; | Mask: 255.255.255.192&lt;br&gt;Subnet range: &lt;b&gt;10.10.0.64 – 10.10.0.127&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Assignable IPs: &lt;b&gt;10.10.0.68 – 10.10.0.126&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Usable capacity: &lt;b&gt;59 IPs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Planned App VM: &lt;b&gt;10.10.0.68&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hosts: &lt;b&gt;20 today / 40 in 6 months&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1F6E6;strokeColor=#25A244;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=20;fontSize=14;fontColor=#10233F;" vertex="1" parent="1">
